      {
        "id": 50,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "每 step token 时序（双图 · E 与 P/D 独立预算）",
        "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "预算说明",
        "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1},
        "transparent": true,
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**Encoder 预算 ≠ `vllm_batch_total_tokens`。** 两者默认上限都是 `--max-num-batched-tokens`（16384），但是**独立计数、独立扣减**：\n\n- **Encoder 图**：`vllm_batch_encoder_output_embeddings`（output embeddings，不是 total_tokens）\n- **P/D 图**：`vllm_batch_context_tokens` + `vllm_batch_generation_tokens`（= total_tokens，**不含** encoder）\n\n实际每 step 用量**通常不相等**（例如 E=7920、P+D=1059 很常见）。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Encoder output embeddings / step（预算 A · 单线）",
        "description": "vllm_batch_encoder_output_embeddings：上一 iteration 新算的 MM encoder 输出 embedding 数。与 total_tokens 无关。虚线 = 16384 上限。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efxtwpht5answc"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 16384,
            "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "spanNulls": false},
            "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"},
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"color": "green", "value": null},
                {"color": "red", "value": 16384}
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": [
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "budget 16384"}, "properties": [
              {"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"dash": [10, 10], "fill": "dash"}},
              {"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed"}},
              {"id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0},
              {"id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1}
            ]}
          ]
        },
        "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}},
        "targets": [
          {"expr": "max_over_time(vllm_batch_encoder_output_embeddings[10s])", "legendFormat": "encoder embeds (max/10s)", "refId": "A"},
          {"expr": "16384", "legendFormat": "budget 16384", "refId": "B"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Prefill + Decode tokens / step（预算 B · 双线）",
        "description": "context_tokens=prefill，generation_tokens=decode。vllm_batch_total_tokens = 两者之和，不含 encoder。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efxtwpht5answc"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 16384,
            "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": false}
