      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "生命周期总览",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 13},
        "transparent": true,
        "options": {
          "mode": "html",
          "code": {
            "language": "html",
            "showLineNumbers": false
          },
          "content": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n  <div style=\"flex:1;border:2px solid #5794f2;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(87,148,242,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#5794f2;margin-bottom:4px\">① CPU · MM Processor</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\">解码图片/视频 · SHM cache</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">不占 GPU 16384 · 进 scheduler 前</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;color:#888;font-size:20px\">→</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1;border:2px solid #ffb357;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(255,179,87,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#ffb357;margin-bottom:4px\">② Scheduler · schedule()</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\">决定本 step 装多少 E 和 P/D</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">维护 waiting[] / skipped_waiting[] / running[]</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;color:#888;font-size:20px\">→</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1.2;border:2px solid #73bf69;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(115,191,105,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#73bf69;margin-bottom:4px\">③ GPU · 1 个 engine step</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\"><b>先 E</b> vision encoder → <b>后 P/D</b> LLM forward</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">不是两个 step · 是同一 iteration 内两段 GPU 计算</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-left:4px solid #f2495c;background:rgba(242,73,92,.06);border-radius:4px;color:#ddd;font-size:12px\">\n  <b>队列高 ≠ token 预算打满</b>：<code>waiting[]</code>=可调度但 budget/KV/slot 不够；<code>skipped_waiting[]</code>=本轮跳过（blocked/LoRA/async KV 等）。见右侧曲线。\n</div>\n</div>"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "调度队列（waiting / skipped_waiting / running）",
        "description": "对齐 vLLM v1 scheduler.py：running=len(running)；waiting=len(waiting)（Prometheus reason=capacity）；skipped_waiting=len(skipped_waiting)（Prometheus reason=deferred）。不含 waiting total 汇总线。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 13},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efphcpq654uf4f"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 15},
            "min": 0
          },
          "overrides": [
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "running"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed"}}]},
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "waiting"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed"}}, {"id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 25}]},
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "skipped_waiting"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed"}}]}
          ]
        },
        "targets": [
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_running{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\"}", "legendFormat": "running", "refId": "A"},
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting_by_reason{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",reason=\"capacity\"}", "legendFormat": "waiting", "refId": "B"},
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting_by_reason{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",reason=\"deferred\"}", "legendFormat": "skipped_waiting", "refId": "C"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 200,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "泳道 2 · Step N 放大（双预算 · 先 E 后 P/D）",
